### About Me

I'm a Computer Science undergraduate (3rd year), currently building a strong foundation in **Data Structures & Algorithms** and **Full Stack Development**, with the goal of becoming a Software Development Engineer.

I'm following a structured, self-paced learning path — Java + DSA fundamentals first, followed by web development (HTML/CSS/JS), backend frameworks, databases, and React. Every project on this profile reflects genuine, hands-on learning rather than tutorials copy-pasted without understanding.

**Currently focused on:** writing clean code, solving problems consistently, and building real, deployed projects — not just following along.

**Open To:** internship opportunities, collaborative projects, and connecting with other engineers/students on a similar path.

